{"parentUuid":"95261321-0f95-4e78-835d-b8666f577aab","isSidechain":true,"userType":"external","cwd":"/app/workspace","sessionId":"8caa67d2-997c-4b7f-ab12-8ec84fe807a8","version":"2.1.19","gitBranch":"","agentId":"ad03678","slug":"snug-orbiting-fountain","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01Fa5kaL3wJWXWRCM2QyNN65","type":"tool_result","content":"=== TIMESTAMP VERIFICATION ===\n\nAccording to the ClusterData2011_2.md file:\n- Trace starts at 19:00 EDT on Sunday May 1, 2011\n- This corresponds to trace timestamp 600s\n\nSample timestamps from data:\nTask Events:\n  5611824441\n  5611824625\n  5612587437\nJob Events:\n  5620274759\n  5629483964\n  5629484512\n\nThese large numbers (in microseconds) represent time since 600s before trace start.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d98dd0bf-031f-42d0-bbdd-34c1bb37c8a5","timestamp":"2026-01-29T04:51:54.850Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"95261321-0f95-4e78-835d-b8666f577aab"}
{"parentUuid":"d98dd0bf-031f-42d0-bbdd-34c1bb37c8a5","isSidechain":true,"userType":"external","cwd":"/app/workspace","sessionId":"8caa67d2-997c-4b7f-ab12-8ec84fe807a8","version":"2.1.19","gitBranch":"","agentId":"ad03678","slug":"snug-orbiting-fountain","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_vrtx_01M5k6NhNcj6cgaMPdhrMXCv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me create a comprehensive summary document.\n\n## Schema Information Extraction Summary\n\nBased on my analysis of the Google Cluster Trace 2011-2 dataset at `/app/workspace/data/`, I've successfully extracted the schema information for both Task Events and Job Events tables.\n\n---\n\n## 1. TASK EVENTS TABLE SCHEMA\n\n**File Location:** `/app/workspace/data/task_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz`\n\n**Total Columns:** 13\n\n### Column Definitions:\n\n| Column | Name | Data Type | Description |\n|--------|------|-----------|-------------|\n| 1 | **timestamp** | Integer (64-bit) | Event timestamp in **microseconds** since 600 seconds before trace start (May 1, 2011 19:00 EDT) |\n| 2 | missing_info | String | Empty string when no missing data; otherwise contains missing data indicators |\n| 3 | **job_id** | Integer | Unique identifier for the job |\n| 4 | **task_index** | Integer | 0-based index of the task within the job |\n| 5 | machine_id | Integer | ID of the machine where the task is/was running (empty for SUBMIT events) |\n| 6 | **event_type** | Integer | Type of event (see event types below) |\n| 7 | user | String (Base64) | Hashed username for confidentiality |\n| 8 | scheduling_class | Integer | Latency sensitivity: 0=free, 1=best effort, 2-3=mid-tier, 4+=production |\n| 9 | priority | Integer | Priority level (0-11, where higher = more important) |\n| 10 | cpu_request | Float | Requested CPU cores (normalized) |\n| 11 | memory_request | Float | Requested memory (normalized) |\n| 12 | disk_space_request | Float | Requested disk space (normalized) |\n| 13 | different_machines_restriction | Boolean | 0 or 1 indicating if tasks must run on different machines |\n\n### Event Type Values for Task Events:\n- **0 = SUBMIT** - Task is submitted to the system\n- **1 = SCHEDULE** - Task is scheduled on a machine\n- **2 = EVICT** - Task is evicted from a machine\n- **3 = FAIL** - Task fails\n- **4 = KILL** - Task is killed\n- **5 = FINISH** - Task completes successfully\n\n**Sample Task Event (SUBMIT):**\n```\n5612587446,,6251995937,33,,0,4Ubmtvv/epOnUEgegvGV9mCxxcZkV4z/Dm8RY/9SEYw=,0,0,0.06873,0.01193,0.0001154,0\n```\n- Timestamp: 5612587446 microseconds\n- Job ID: 6251995937\n- Task Index: 33\n- Event Type: 0 (SUBMIT)\n\n---\n\n## 2. JOB EVENTS TABLE SCHEMA\n\n**File Location:** `/app/workspace/data/job_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz`\n\n**Total Columns:** 8\n\n### Column Definitions:\n\n| Column | Name | Data Type | Description |\n|--------|------|-----------|-------------|\n| 1 | **timestamp** | Integer (64-bit) | Event timestamp in **microseconds** since 600 seconds before trace start (May 1, 2011 19:00 EDT) |\n| 2 | missing_info | String | Empty string when no missing data; otherwise contains missing data indicators |\n| 3 | **job_id** | Integer | Unique identifier for the job |\n| 4 | **event_type** | Integer | Type of event (see event types below) |\n| 5 | user | String (Base64) | Hashed username for confidentiality |\n| 6 | scheduling_class | Integer | Latency sensitivity: 0=free, 1=best effort, 2-3=mid-tier, 4+=production |\n| 7 | job_name | String (Base64) | Hashed logical job name |\n| 8 | logical_job_name | String (Base64) | Hashed logical job name (alternative identifier) |\n\n### Event Type Values for Job Events:\n- **0 = SUBMIT** - Job is submitted to the system\n- **1 = SCHEDULE** - Job is scheduled\n- **3 = FAIL** - Job fails\n- **4 = KILL** - Job is killed\n- **5 = FINISH** - Job completes successfully\n\n**Note:** Event type 2 (EVICT) is not present in the job events data, as jobs are not evicted (only tasks are).\n\n**Sample Job Event (SUBMIT):**\n```\n5636908423,,6252021948,0,XzZHJR6eXZamIB7lSFTc/NXTbAKtt3SoOI8Fp/RtnwU=,2,Dak9tgVohhwVjNUJs8UZ4GON38RQ6n1KXgCOPK1NdSc=,oVQW4BB6g9OxJY1p0jZg3hr00UZ169KuGc0FzEDJoUE=\n```\n- Timestamp: 5636908423 microseconds\n- Job ID: 6252021948\n- Event Type: 0 (SUBMIT)\n\n---\n\n## KEY FINDINGS:\n\n1. **Timestamp Format:** Both tables use timestamps in **microseconds** (not seconds or milliseconds)\n2. **SUBMIT Event Value:** **0** represents a SUBMIT event in both tables\n3. **Job ID Location:** Column 3 in both tables\n4. **Task Index:** Only in Task Events table (Column 4)\n5. **Event Type Location:** Column 6 in Task Events, Column 4 in Job Events\n6. **Missing Info Field:** Column 2 is typically empty, indicating complete data\n\n---\n\n## Sources:\n- [Google Cluster Data GitHub Repository](https://github.com/google/cluster-data/blob/master/ClusterData2011_2.md)\n- [Google Cluster Usage Traces PDF Schema](https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Auday-Al-Dulaimy/post/Are-there-any-datasets-for-cloudSim/attachment/59d61de379197b807797be3e/AS:273823268573184@1442295962733/download/Google+cluster+usage+traces.pdf)\n- [Analysis and Clustering of Workload in Google](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1501.01426)\n- [Google Cluster Trace Dataset Overview](https://www.emergentmind.com/topics/google-cluster-trace-dataset)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":430,"cache_read_input_tokens":43027,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":430,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":7}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXb4xtVyf9bZYaSv2j25m","type":"assistant","uuid":"afcb00f9-ccd3-4a7c-8930-9393d05b5757","timestamp":"2026-01-29T04:52:29.598Z"}
